ObjectWidth [SimTalk] - Button
Sets the Width of the Button designated by <Path> with which it is shown in the Frame.
Remarks
If you enter a long label, you have to adjust the width so that the label fits on the button without the text
being cut off.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.ObjectWidth:integer
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type integer.
Example
MyButton.ObjectWidth := 4 // meters
